{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2022-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1643673600, "end_date": 1646092799, "month_true_total": 9, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:53:32 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "111206225", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018102191", "personaname": "< blank >", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018102191/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 725, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 725, "last_played": 1646011881, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good Luck with trying to get this game running via Steam.  Finding support via Steam or EA, the owners of the program, impossible.  I purchased the program thru Steam.  When I ask for support they say they cannot support programs that are not theirs.  Impossible to find support on EA.  The problem...  I launch the program from Steam using the \"PLAY\" button, the screen flashes after 20 seconds a small window comes up says Origin, then a big window flashes Origin EA and then is gone leaving me back to the Steam program.  Arrrrggghh.  Don't waste your money and never purchase a program from Steam that they do not support!", "timestamp_created": 1646012418, "timestamp_updated": 1646012418, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.655975937843322754", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "111110644", "author": {"steamid": "76561198162736581", "personaname": "Spital53", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/drspital/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3158, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1788, "last_played": 1731104257, "avatar": "60d3f3196da4620788caf5a63f6de952e2b0cdd8"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of three best games I have ever played (other two are Mass Effect 1 and 2)", "timestamp_created": 1645913048, "timestamp_updated": 1645913048, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "111006166", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057631912", "personaname": "michael_smith25", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198057631912/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 4755, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3506, "last_played": 1727580028, "avatar": "c3a062148ec333692b1036fd7193275ee1ca211f"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love the Mass Effect Trilogy and the spin-off of Mass Effect Andromeda - the only negative is the stupid politics of who actually owns and has the rights to modify the games either through player generated content or mods or whatever else. Steam refuses to fight for the rights to exclusively use the game, instead allowing EA to dictate that \"the games will only run when our platforms are engaged and we have verified the file structure as unmodified as per the contract you agreed to....\" (EA customer service flunky, 2021) - which is complete horse-pucky! Both Mass Effect series and the Dragon Age series of games run just fine without having the EA platform or the Origin platform - it is all about control. Personally, I think that we as the \"purchaser\" of the game - then \"own\" the game and we should have the right to play it where we choose, not where we are told we have to. But I love the games - and continually play them on Steam.  EA can go hop off a pier if they want - they are useless anyway.", "timestamp_created": 1645818369, "timestamp_updated": 1645818369, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.618385434150695801", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "110681186", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003127640", "personaname": "thornwatch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198003127640/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 35, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 35, "last_played": 1645425949, "avatar": "f26b6ae40fcaabd3117059d5c21e66a1046971b1"}, "language": "english", "review": "So bad.", "timestamp_created": 1645426147, "timestamp_updated": 1645426147, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.361549615859985352", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "110545610", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046523440", "personaname": "Goon on the Moon", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ReaperR33/", "num_games_owned": 570, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 8472, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6569, "last_played": 1788889671, "avatar": "7717e3a621d510cc267d8c0d96dc6b3b9e2d3664"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game. ♥♥♥♥ DRM. Companies like EA and the things they do to make consumer's lives that much more inconvenient i.e. having to use this AND Origins anyway just to play a game you wanted to avoid Origin for are why I support piracy.\n\nAs sad as that is to say some things, especially crap DRM, don't deserve our support. Only buy this if you are [i]willing[/i] to put up with Origin breaking your install every other update just so you can possibly play the multiplayer with some friends. If you just want to play the single player for the experience: Go to the yarr-harr bay.", "timestamp_created": 1645259913, "timestamp_updated": 1645259913, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 35, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.73174738883972168", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 2, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "110329384", "author": {"steamid": "76561198100647325", "personaname": "vesselmarietoken", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vesselmarietoken/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1102, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1102, "last_played": 1644549394, "avatar": "5ae4250d720f3ad5810d42d9f6cedbaf69ad5682"}, "language": "english", "review": "There is no Shepard without Vakarian.", "timestamp_created": 1644972250, "timestamp_updated": 1644972250, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505747139453887939", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "110263769", "author": {"steamid": "76561198254023891", "personaname": "Toshka", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198254023891/", "num_games_owned": 131, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 4596, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 705, "last_played": 1734904071, "avatar": "a1bad4b89